e reactions for cards/buttons:\n  - 03: hotspot over back (16,64,40,40) → 02; hotspot over add (319,64,40,40) → 04.\n  - 04: hotspot over close → 03; button instance reaction → 03.\n  - 02: hotspot over balance card? card instance reaction fine. FAB instance reaction. 'See all' text inside section header instance → hotspot over it.\n  - 05: pay/cancel buttons reactions.\n  - 06: Home button reaction.\n  Hotspots: fill [] rectangles named 'Hotspot ...' — visible=false? Invisible nodes with reactions still work in prototype (fills empty = clickable in prototype). Set fills=[] (not visible=false — visible false nodes may not be clickable; use fills=[] opacity? empty fills renders nothing but remains interactive ✓).\n- 04 button → 03, close hotspot → 03.\n\nAlso 03 add-card hotspot → 04; 04 close → 03.\n\nTransition: DISSOLVE 0.25 for all; sheet 03→04 could be 'MOVE_IN' from bottom? navigation NAVIGATE transition type 'MOVE_IN' direction 'LEFT'? For slide-up feel: transition {type:'MOVE_IN', direction:'BOTTOM'? } — SlideTransition direction: 'LEFT'|'RIGHT'|'TOP'|'BOTTOM'. MOVE_IN with direction 'BOTTOM'? Hmm MOVE_IN slides new over old from direction. For sheet, 'MOVE_IN' + 'BOTTOM' would be nice: {type:'MOVE_IN', direction:'BOTTOM', duration:0.3}. And 04→03 close: {type:'MOVE_OUT', direction:'BOTTOM'}. I'll use those for 03↔04, DISSOLVE elsewhere. If invalid, fallback DISSOLVE — wrap try.\n\nAlso delete interactions default none.\n\nExtra: set 02/03 frames' 'Expenses'... fine.\n\nAlso frame labels above frames — small caption texts on page (outside frames).\n\nLet me now also confirm icons' vector strokes exist (Icon_Plus vector fills=[] — strokes must exist; screenshot shows black line icons ✓).\n\nAlright, also one more: given Button instance at 343×56 — 04 needs 335×52? resizing instance with auto-layout primary/counter FIXED: resize works, text stays centered ✓ (component uses AL center).\n\nTime to write Script 1. Also name nodes clearly.\n\nOne concern: use_figma