mid. Standard iOS sheet dim: black 40-50% over white → gray; status text white would be hard to read; black text also hard. Real iOS dims the BACKGROUND page but status bar area of the presenting screen shows the presenting app's status bar (dark text on dimmed light bg = fine). So KEEP black glyphs — matches iOS behavior. Skip recolor. OK.\n\nTextField value override with mono: value node fontName override — the value text node in instance: set fontName {Roboto Mono, Medium} then characters. Font loaded ✓.\n\nFocused input: find input node in instance by name 'Input' (visible ✓): fills=[white], strokes=[solid brand], strokeWeight=1.5.\n\nAlso '1 of 3' caption on wallet: place x=16,y=318 (between card 311 and dots 323?) — dots at y=323..329; text 11 tall y=318..329 overlapping dots region? dots centered x 165..209; text left x=16..60 ✓ no overlap. Fine.\n\nPromo card: PromoCard instance (16,352). ends 448. Section 'Transactions' at (16,468) 24 tall; rowsCard (16,496) ends 700.\n\nScreen 03 ids: back/add icon buttons (for hotspots later), etc.\n\nWrite script 4 now. Also captions '03 · Wallet', '04 · Add Card'.","signature":"8b6570542a5d4cf3b17535ce"}],"id":"48817ccc-40bb-422a-9a29-53d01d3c3bfa","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"259a9f97-bab6-42ed-a1f7-e48e66488de3","uuid":"8442dcbe-f19e-4380-9d7e-5a8b0c0ef4ad","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:46:26.518Z","thinking_duration_ms":30498}
